## 🚀 **RAPID EXECUTION COMMANDS**

### **Phase 1 Commands**
```bash
# Initialize repositories
npm run anchor  # Validate current state
# Execute git setup tasks
npm run audit   # Validate git setup
```

### **Phase 2 Commands**
```bash
# Implement holon governance
npm run governance  # Activate governance
npm run audit       # Validate governance
```

### **Phase 3 Commands**
```bash
# Improve test coverage
npm run test:coverage  # Check current coverage
# Implement missing tests
npm run test          # Validate all tests pass
```

### **Phase 4 Commands**
```bash
# Launch stability epic
npm run health        # Check current stability
npm run anchor        # Validate system-wide health
```

